# Ciutatis — inherited project handbook

Use this file when opening the repo cold. The full audit is `doc/plans/2026-08-12-inherited-codebase-audit.md`. HTML: `reports/inherited-codebase-audit.html`.

## What this is

Ciutatis is a civic fork of Paperclip: a control plane for AI agents organized as institutions. Humans (the board) create institutions, hire agents, assign requests, approve governed actions, and enforce budgets. Agents run outside the control plane via adapters and phone home on heartbeats.

## Do not trust these maps

- There is no top-level `ui/` package. The board UI is `apps/landing/src/admin` (Next.js host, React Router basename `/admin`).
- Default DB is embedded PostgreSQL, not PGlite. Data: `~/.paperclip/instances/default/`.
- Root package name is `paperclip`. CLI is `ciutatis` / `paperclipai`.
- GitHub Actions in `.github/workflows` trigger on `master`. Default branch here is `main`.
- `pnpm lint` is a no-op.

## Vocabulary

| UI / civic docs | HTTP / SQL | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| Institution | `companies` / `/api/companies` | Tenant |
| Request | `issues` / `/api/issues` | Work item |
| Objective | `goals` / `/api/goals` | Goal |
| Channel | `agents` | AI employee |

Physical tables were not renamed. TypeScript has civic aliases (`institutions`, `requests`, `objectives`).

## Day-one commands

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm dev                 # API :3100
pnpm dev:landing         # public + admin :3000
pnpm paperclipai run     # onboard + doctor + server
pnpm -r typecheck
pnpm test:run
pnpm build
```

Admin: `http://localhost:3000/admin`. Health: `http://localhost:3100/api/health`.

Do not start long-lived `pnpm dev` from unattended agent sessions.

## Where to change what

| Change | Touch |
|---|---|
| API / orchestration | `server/src/` |
| Schema | `packages/db/src/schema/` then `pnpm db:generate` |
| Types / validators / paths | `packages/shared/` |
| Board UI | `apps/landing/src/admin/` |
| Public site | `apps/landing/app/` + `src/admin/pages/Public*.tsx` |
| Hosted API | `workers/api/` + `packages/db-cloudflare/` |
| Adapters | `packages/adapters/*` + `server/src/adapters/registry.ts` |
| CLI | `cli/src/` |

Keep company scoping. Log mutations. Sync db → shared → server → UI (and Workers if the feature is hosted).

## Two production stacks

1. Self-host: Express + Postgres (Docker/ECS/npm). Env prefix `PAPERCLIP_DEPLOYMENT_MODE`.
2. Hosted: Cloudflare Workers + D1 + OpenNext. Env `DEPLOYMENT_MODE`. Manual wrangler deploy. npm release does not ship `ciutatis.com`.

## Invariants (spec vs code)

- Single assignee: one `assigneeAgentId` column. True.
- Atomic checkout: **not true**. `requestService.checkout` is an unconditional update; the route skips `assertCompanyAccess`.
- Budget hard-stop: true (`budgets.ts` + heartbeat `getInvocationBlock`).
- Approval gates: true for hire/strategy paths.
- Activity log: true on many mutations, not checkout.

